      "role": "user",
      "content": "Right, I see. So when they talk about these \"biological cognitive hierarchies,\" how do they typically address the criticisms regarding environmental factors or socioeconomic disparities? I want to make sure I capture how they defend their position against the idea that IQ gaps are just a result of systemic issues or different living conditions.",
